{"id":"615580","name":"荠菜海肠水饺","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615580/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荠菜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"剩饺子馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面团","amount":"适量"},{"name":"海肠","amount":"小许"}],"sub":[{"name":"白菜帮","amount":"2片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"荠菜摘洗干净。","img":"images/615580/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沥干水。","img":"images/615580/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅烧开水，放荠菜焯水。","img":"images/615580/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开即可。","img":"images/615580/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出过冷水。","img":"images/615580/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放小许食盐。","img":"images/615580/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放清水。","img":"images/615580/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放面粉揉成面团。","img":"images/615580/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖起来醒着。","img":"images/615580/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"这是天不亮起来给少爷他爹包饺子剩的馅。","img":"images/615580/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取荠菜。","img":"images/615580/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取白菜帮。","img":"images/615580/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"剁成末。","img":"images/615580/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"浸泡的海肠。","img":"images/615580/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"切海肠。","img":"images/615580/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"所有食材放一起，放食用油、食盐、鸡精和生抽。","img":"images/615580/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/615580/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"取面团。","img":"images/615580/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"揪成小剂子。","img":"images/615580/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/615580/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"包饺子。","img":"images/615580/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/615580/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"把饺子汤煮开，清水煮开一样的。","img":"images/615580/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"下饺子。","img":"images/615580/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"煮熟。","img":"images/615580/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/615580/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"成品。汤汁很多很鲜美。","img":"images/615580/step_27.